# This branch is the built site, exactly as GitHub Pages serves it: HTML, the
# web copies of the figures, and the shared shell. Nothing here is hand-written
# — publish.ps1 regenerates all of it from the source on the main branch.
#
# The rules below keep source and machinery from leaking in, so that what is
# committed is only ever what a browser fetches.

# Source. It belongs on main. Note this cannot be written as `images/`: the web
# copies of the figures live in `chapters/media/images/`, and a bare directory
# pattern matches at every level, so that rule would ignore the whole site's
# artwork. Match the source formats instead — the site only ever ships .webp
# and .svg.
*.tex
*.md
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# Compiled PDFs live in Google Drive.
*.pdf

# LaTeX build by-products.
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.gen.tex

# The build itself, its configuration, and authoring scaffolding.
web-pipeline/
course.yml
site.psd1
hub.yml
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/

# Python bytecode from the pipeline's renderers.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Drafts, not published.
y2s1/
system-design/

# OS / editor noise.
image.png
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.vscode/
